27	    \item[] Answer: \answerYes{}
28	    \item[] Justification: All code, raw JSON result files, per-seed routing-weight logs, and a self-verification script (\texttt{verify.py}) that re-derives every numerical claim from raw data are included in the supplementary material and will be open-sourced upon acceptance. All datasets used (ETT, Weather, Electricity, Traffic, Solar, Exchange) are publicly available standard LTSF benchmarks.
29	
